      "question": "Hence find the coordinates of the stationary point of C, where y = 27x^(1/2) - x^(3/2) - 20 and dy/dx = (27/2)x^(-1/2) - (3/2)x^(1/2).",
      "status": "ready",
      "answer": "(9, 34)",
      "steps": [
        "A stationary point has dy/dx = 0.",
        "So (27/2)x^(-1/2) = (3/2)x^(1/2).",
        "Multiply both sides by 2x^(1/2): 27 = 3x, so x = 9.",
        "Substitute x = 9 into y: y = 27(3) - 27 - 20.",
        "y = 81 - 27 - 20 = 34.",
        "The stationary point is (9, 34)."
      ]
