      "question": "A curve C has equation y = 2x^2(x - 5). Using calculus, find the x coordinates of the stationary points of C.",
      "status": "ready",
      "answer": "x = 0 and x = 10/3",
      "steps": [
        "Expand: y = 2x^3 - 10x^2.",
        "Differentiate: dy/dx = 6x^2 - 20x.",
        "Set dy/dx = 0: 6x^2 - 20x = 0.",
        "Factorise: 2x(3x - 10) = 0.",
        "So x = 0 or x = 10/3."
      ]
